179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\"><span>Assomigliava a questo. </span><em>Ma questo lo ha fatto DALL-E</em></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"subscribe-widget\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidget\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-justifyContent-center pc-reset\"><div class=\"container-IpPqBD\"><form class=\"form form-M5sC90\" action=\"/api/v1/free?nojs=true\" method=\"post\" novalidate=\"\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_url\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_referrer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"current_url\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"current_referrer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_session_url\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_session_referrer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referral_code\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referring_pub_id\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"additional_referring_pub_ids\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source_post_id\"><div class=\"sideBySideWrap-vGXrwP\"><div class=\"emailInputWrapper-QlA86j\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-minWidth-0 pc-position-relative pc-reset flex-auto-UL7Y7f\"><input name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email...\" aria-label=\"Email\" type=\"email\" class=\"pencraft emailInput-OkIMeB input-y4v6N4 inputText-pV_yWb\"></div></div><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft rightButton primary subscribe-btn button-VFSdkv buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\"><span class=\"button-text \">Subscribe</span></button></div><div id=\"error-container\"></div></form><div class=\"animationWrapper-QRL6aQ\"></div></div></div></div><p><strong>Non sapevo bene che farmene:</strong><span> le cose da fare di solito le salvo in digitale.</span></p><p><strong>E allora, non so bene perché, ho cominciato, ogni giorno, per un anno, ad annotare su questo taccuino una frase, una citazione, una cosa da ricordare.</strong></p><p>Un po’ uno sprone a leggere qualcosa di interessante tutti i giorni. Un po’ una inutile abitudine, alla quale mi sono affezionato.</p><p><span>Ecco, alcune di queste frasi, citazioni, o cose da ricordare, </span><strong>le trovi nel regalo di Natale di Artifacts.</strong></p><p><strong>È un libricino di qualche pagina</strong><span>, che puoi sfogliare</span></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://heyzine.com/flip-book/1143440e50.html&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Se clicci qui&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/1143440e50.html\"><span>Se clicci qui</span></a></p><p>oppure, semplicemente,</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nJES0b8i1KydGV_jYOz1xDwD4vut9zeg/view?usp=sharing&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Lo scarichi qui&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nJES0b8i1KydGV_jYOz1xDwD4vut9zeg/view?usp=sharing\"><span>Lo scarichi qui</span></a></p><p><span>È un modo per ringraziarti di essere iscritto/a ad Artifacts e dirti che, anche se magari non ci conosciamo, </span><strong>mi fa piacere farti un regalo.</strong></p><div><hr></div><p>Comunque, questa è la copertina,</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UGwo!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1cd8395e-1a40-4387-8ed4-cb202734fa32_1414x2000.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UGwo!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1cd8395e-1a40-4387-8ed4-cb202734fa32_1414x2000.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UGwo!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1cd8395e-1a40-4387-8ed4-cb202734fa32_1414x2000.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UGwo!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1cd8395e-1a40-4387-8ed4-cb202734fa32_1414x2000.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UGwo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1cd8395e-1a40-4387-8ed4-cb202734fa32_1414x2000.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UGwo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1cd8395e-1a40-4387-8ed4-cb202734fa32_1414x2000.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"357.85007072135784\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1c